~ start
if DialogueHandler.first_time_seeing_safe:
	!! [wait=1] there's a safe hidden in here.
do DialogueHandler.showing_safe_view.emit()
=> looking_at_safe
Do you want to put in the code?
- Yes
	Click the CODE button to input the code.
- No
	do DialogueHandler.exit_safe_view()
=> END

~ looking_at_safe
if !DialogueHandler.knows_safe_code:
	I need to find the safe code first.
	do DialogueHandler.exit_safe_view()
	=> END!
=> END

~ inspect_safe_items
Inspect the safe items.
=> END

~ shipment
This should be enough to incriminate Alex Miller.
- Take it.
	do DialogueHandler.take_shipment()
=> END

~ watch 
Who needs a watch worth thousands of dollars when you can use your phone?
=> END

~ gold_bars
I would take these...if I wasn't a little ol' law-abiding citizen.
=> END